@startuml
title Nimbus 服务端架构流程图

actor Client as "Qt客户端/CLI"

rectangle "muduo网络层\n(TcpServer/EventLoop)" as Muduo {
    [FileServer]
}

rectangle "业务逻辑层" as Logic {
    [协议解析\n(Protobuf)]
    [业务分发\n(FileServer)]
    [分片上传/合并\n(file_server_chunk.cpp)]
    [用户认证/鉴权\n(file_server_db.cpp)]
    [文件操作接口\n(MinioStorage)]
}

database "MinIO\n对象存储" as MinIO
database "MySQL\n用户/会话表" as MySQL

Client --> Muduo : TCP/Protobuf请求
Muduo --> Logic : 解析请求
Logic --> [协议解析\n(Protobuf)] : 解析消息
[协议解析\n(Protobuf)] --> [业务分发\n(FileServer)] : 分发请求

[业务分发\n(FileServer)] --> [分片上传/合并\n(file_server_chunk.cpp)] : 分片上传/合并
[业务分发\n(FileServer)] --> [用户认证/鉴权\n(file_server_db.cpp)] : 注册/登录/鉴权
[业务分发\n(FileServer)] --> [文件操作接口\n(MinioStorage)] : 文件上传/下载/删除

[分片上传/合并\n(file_server_chunk.cpp)] --> [文件操作接口\n(MinioStorage)] : 合并后上传
[用户认证/鉴权\n(file_server_db.cpp)] --> MySQL : 查询/写入用户、会话
[文件操作接口\n(MinioStorage)] --> MinIO : S3 API操作

@enduml